{"id":1610820,"imdb":"tt38781172","en":"Santo António - Lisbon Love","orig":"Les Mariages de Saint Antoine","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"Lisbon's traditional Saint Anthony's Weddings have hit rock bottom. At least, that's what Stardust, a major French multinational poised to take over the event, believes. Carmo and Valentim, two Lisbon City Hall employees who have spent more than 25 years organizing the celebrations, are given a harsh ultimatum: reinvent the event and turn it into a modern success, or lose their jobs. Directed by the filmmaker behind The Gilded Cage, Saint Anthony is a vibrant comedy and a heartfelt love letter to Lisbon. A celebration of human connection, identity, and cultural resilience in an increasingly globalized world.","rd":"2026-09-10","rt":119,"g":[35,10751],"lang":"pt","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Blablabla Media","logo":null,"c":""}],"countries":["PT"],"langs":["Portuguese","French"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"PT","d":"2026-09-10"}],"dir":["Ruben Alves"],"prod":[],"wri":["Fernando Pérez","Ruben Alves"],"mus":[],"dop":["André Szankowski"],"cast":[{"n":"Rita Blanco","ch":"Carmo","p":"/cAVhna69CqjUwVdPdk72AqaYCka.jpg"},{"n":"Joaquim Monchique","ch":"Valentim","p":"/crEkQOcWcCcsCtNRF1VstaTiOQ6.jpg"},{"n":"Ana Bola","ch":"Maria","p":"/5UYa0pHTxArsHR2kNKCvb0KUR5d.jpg"},{"n":"Maria Rueff","ch":"Liliana","p":"/zrmGnEKyFJizdDpfVDQqgsjvEIL.jpg"},{"n":"Pedro Nercessian","ch":"Marcelo","p":"/eFTH1WOAySvUsf8N9HETeLS6fH.jpg"},{"n":"Maria João Bastos","ch":"Beatriz","p":"/Er5iWHM6fEe2nXV5W27xZejgiw.jpg"},{"n":"Paco León","ch":"Jaime","p":"/dZd0Z3mUgXrE0y21KknLp40Ivuk.jpg"},{"n":"Jacqueline Corado","ch":"Fátima","p":"/155XFrieAu1g9Nipbe7FDruiTbN.jpg"},{"n":"João Catarré","ch":"António","p":"/ScWOeOQJNbhHvLXtuptm6VSxix.jpg"},{"n":"Inês Aires Pereira","ch":"Sofia","p":"/etAXmJDbbZGctvFJnH6f8Mgs2Ef.jpg"},{"n":"Nuno Nolasco","ch":"Tiago","p":"/m1XKGKdlz4dwKUeFfPPC0v7Ne4u.jpg"},{"n":"Pedro Nuno","ch":"Fábio","p":"/fBHHo7ZYYwAHpqDVfOWjzrKnfVY.jpg"},{"